			"notes": "Initial Dragsim Utils release for Minecraft 26.1.2 on Fabric.\n\n- Dragon, zealot, slayer and personal drop tracking.\n- Dungeon map, key alerts, puzzle/terminal guidance and personal bests.\n- Mining sessions, powder rates, drill fuel information and forge/recipe tools.\n- Storage previews, item inspection and inventory protection options.\n- Player profile browsing for inventory, pets, progression and public rankings.\n- Missing collection suggestions exclude the unreleased Auto Recombobulator, Scarf's Thesis and Blaze pet.\n- Customizable HUDs, themes, favorites, settings search and module shortcuts.\n- Optional Discord Rich Presence with controls for shared activity details.\n- One-time import of compatible Endsight settings and tracker history.\n- Manual updates with readable sources and artifact verification instructions.\n\nNetworth is temporarily disabled. Remote item pricing is not included in 1.0.0.\n\n### Requirements\nMinecraft **26.1.2**, Fabric Loader **0.19.1+**, Fabric API **0.155.0+ for 26.1.2**, Java **25+**.\n\nInstall the regular jar in your Fabric instance's mods folder. Updates are installed manually.\n\nBuilt by GitHub from commit [`a36a529`](https://github.com/RealZones/DragsimUtils/commit/a36a529315dd6de218ae9ed250be65f5d4bfa20c)."
		}
